OL,3,GNEWSABogus bailiff left victim feeling
OL,4,A'like he was having a heart attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former MP says he thought he was
OL,7,Fgoing to have a heart attack after
OL,8,Fbeing targeted by a scammer pretending
OL,9,Fto be a bailiff.
OL,11,FHuw Edwards, who served as Labour MP
OL,12,Ffor Monmouth from 1997 to 2005, was
OL,13,Fdriving to a meeting when he received a
OL,14,Fcall telling him he owed #860 to a debt
OL,15,Fcollection agency.
OL,17,FEdwards and his wife said they
OL,18,Feventually established it was a scam
OL,19,Fafter speaking to a friend in the
OL,20,Finsolvency business.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
